Epic: bd-01KXYJK0XSA3RNH9ANMVC96EPE

Establish a reproducible consumption boundary after the Gale migration APIs are ready.

Scope
- choose a tagged published Gale artifact or another reviewed immutable pin;
- forbid a durable build dependency on local publishLocal state;
- align Scalafim Scala.js from 1.20.1 to a Gale-compatible version, currently proven with 1.22.0;
- record Scala, sbt, JDK, Node, JVM, and Scala.js compatibility policy;
- add a minimal JVM and full optimized Scala.js consumer probe in CI or equivalent reproducible evidence.

Acceptance
A clean checkout can resolve Gale without relying on another developers machine, compile a representative DMat plus spectral call on Scala 3.4.2, and complete both JVM execution and fullLinkJS. The selected Gale commit has the required license and artifact provenance for its distribution route.
